matters of blood and ambition. \"The Hanged Man,\" Alger Wilson, proposed a high-stakes exchange. He sought the head of Qilangos, one of the infamous seven Pirate Admirals, and tasked \"Justice,\" Audrey Hall, with leveraging her noble influence in Backlund to hunt the wind-blessed killer.\n\nIn the foggy streets of the Loen capital, Audrey’s quest led her to the Beyonder duo, Fors Wall and Xio Derecha. As the web tightened around the Admiral, Klein sought the intervention of his mentor, the mysterious Mr. Azik. By weaving together the threads of divinity, ancient power, and mortal cunning, The Fool ensured the Tarot Club’s first great triumph: the fall of Qilangos.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Detective","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cult","rank":66,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cultivation","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosmic Horror","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Lord of Mysteries Specials","english":"Lord of Mysteries Specials","native":"诡秘之主 特别篇","romaji":"Guimi Zhi Zhu Specials","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"诡秘之主特别篇"}]},"trailer":{"id":"2B8-GKoyGMU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2B8-GKoyGMU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}